HST Office: "Bỏ qua lỗi" of numbers stored as text is saved in .xlsx and .ods.

- xlsx import (worksheetfragment): <ignoredErrors><ignoredError sqref numberStoredAsText="1"/> adds its
  cells to the document's ignored ranges, so files from the leading suite keep ignored cells unmarked.
- xlsx export (excdoc): the ranges of each sheet are written in the same element, after the page
  settings and before <drawing> (CT_Worksheet order), clipped to the sheet limits of the format.
- ods: the document setting "HstIgnoredTextNumbers" (settings.xml, ScDocumentConfiguration) holds
  "sheet!A1:B2 ..." with sheets by index; it is read before the sheets exist and resolved on first use.

